// Motionblue primary: explosive slug launcher. 3-round clip, 0.5s fire.
// Explosive (direct + splash, ~4m radius) with strong self-push for blast
// jumps. Direct hit is 2; splash is 1. Post-hit i-frames keep splash from
// stacking on the same target. A true inner blast nucleus (2 at center on
// world hits, not only actor contact) is deferred. The mblueGrenade tool
// is also deferred.
